{"id":"n37862-2-7","stage":5,"title":"구걸 · 乞求","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37862-2-7-1","ko":"헤어지자는 여자 친구한테 내가 엄청 매달렸어.","zh":"那个说要分手的女朋友，我可是拼命挽留她的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"헤어지자는","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；자는：引用共同做某事的提议，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어지자는","audio":"/audio/ad4f56743cf36e0f5970.mp3"}},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","explanation":"여자：女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"친구한테","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구한테","audio":"/audio/d3b5294e4e8555bc0bef.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"엄청","meaning":"相当，特别","explanation":"엄청：相当，特别。","readings":[{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67346","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄청","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3"}},{"text":"매달렸어.","meaning":"靠，依赖，追求","explanation":"매달리다：靠，依赖，追求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"매달리다","audio":"/audio/99418b20136ee17b1cd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15970","senseId":"5","lemma":"매달리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매달렸어","audio":"/audio/095c8211ab41a0ff4608.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"31ff8e60cae7be0a","term":"엄청","zh":"相当，特别","audio":"/audio/31ff8e60cae7be0afe40.mp3","entryId":"67346","definition":"量或程度十分过分地。","pronunciation":["엄청"]},{"id":"99418b20136ee17b","term":"매달리다","zh":"靠，依赖，追求","audio":"/audio/99418b20136ee17b1cd2.mp3","entryId":"15970","definition":"依存或依靠于某物。","pronunciation":["매ː달리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9b19b7acd6f657ef27b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37862-2-7-2","ko":"꼭 그렇게 사랑을 구걸까지 해야 돼?","zh":"非得做到那种乞求爱情的地步吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/a